{"3629490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Prototype Juan: A Tale of Two Mundos", "steam_appid": 3629490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Banished.   Pixelated.   Determined.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Juan</strong> had it all— a vibrant world, a best friend named <strong>Greg</strong>, and an adventure waiting to unfold. But after a fateful encounter with a grumpy <strong>Dinosaur</strong>, he’s been cast down into the <strong><i>prototype</i> version</strong> of his own game! Now trapped in a 1-bit world of unfinished code and forgotten assets, Juan must fight, platform, and puzzle his way back to where he belongs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between two distinct art styles—gritty 1-bit and polished 16-bit—as you uncover the secrets of the <i>Prototype Realm</i>. Use your whip, shield, and quick reflexes to survive enemy encounters, traverse treacherous environments, and collect the keys needed to escape this digital purgatory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Juan reclaim his adventure, or is he doomed to remain a half-finished idea?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: Optimized for <strong>Steam Deck</strong> — runs smoothly at 60 FPS with default Proton settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629490/extras/55d1c62430025f48bce0ae22ee6b9ed8.avif?t=1760980876\" width=1560 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 🕹️ <strong>Fast-paced 2D action platforming with tight controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629490/extras/dac132bd7bd03d203e82aecf895c4cff.poster.avif?t=1760980876\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629490/extras/dac132bd7bd03d203e82aecf895c4cff.webm?t=1760980876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629490/extras/dac132bd7bd03d203e82aecf895c4cff.mp4?t=1760980876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ⚔️ <strong>Whip-cracking combat and strategic shield-shot mechanics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629490/extras/0a8de0b168120ecbe6ab5c0a36d85e1e.poster.avif?t=1760980876\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629490/extras/0a8de0b168120ecbe6ab5c0a36d85e1e.webm?t=1760980876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629490/extras/0a8de0b168120ecbe6ab5c0a36d85e1e.mp4?t=1760980876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 🎨 <strong>Unique dual-art style aesthetic: 1-bit prototype vs. full-color 16-bit adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629490/extras/cdd90f78ae25db2255b10b179d4b7456.poster.avif?t=1760980876\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629490/extras/cdd90f78ae25db2255b10b179d4b7456.webm?t=1760980876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3629490/extras/cdd90f78ae25db2255b10b179d4b7456.mp4?t=1760980876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 🔑 <strong>Metroidvania-style exploration—find hidden keys to progress</strong></p><p class=\"